The '''West Reaches''' are a sub-location of the [[Moonglade Marsh]].

== Features ==
The '''West Reaches''' are a large platform above the {{Zone|Westbound Wetlands}} with [[Fig Log|Fig Tree]]s to chop. Additionally, [[Lushlilac|Lushlilac Bushes]] can be picked for {{Item|Lushlilac}}.

=== Murkwater Outpost ===
{{Main|Murkwater Outpost}}
{{Item|Forest Essence}} can be traded with {{NPCSprite|Rosemary}} to gain special perks.

